WEBVTT

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:05.280
Attention, please!

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:09.060
I'm sick of all your smiling!

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:13.660
There it is!

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.600
Standing in heels makes my feet sore!

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:20.310
What is this Selfish?

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:22.500
Perhaps it's supposed to be a flight attendant?

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:26.970
Is there a princess among our passengers today?

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:29.620
It's looking for the princess!

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:31.310
Indeed it is.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.650
Where did you hide her?

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:36.170
We wouldn't tell you even if we knew!

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:39.030
Then it seems I have no use for you.

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:40.170
Selfish!

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:42.500
Attention, please!

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:46.350
Precure Rosetta Reflection!

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:53.500
Self!

00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:00.040
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:01.780
Ace Shot!

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:03.080
Bang!

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.780
Self!

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:13.310
Love loove looooove!

00:01:20.690 --> 00:01:21.990
Have a memento!

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:31.640
I'm deeply sorry!

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:36.050
I put everyone in danger because my barrier was too weak...

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:37.990
That's not it, really!

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:40.050
It's not your fault, Rosetta.

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:42.670
We all share the blame.

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:43.650
However...

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:48.120
I have nothing to add.

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:52.910
You realize your own shortcomings.

00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:54.570
Do your best to overcome them.

00:01:58.870 --> 00:02:03.240
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:05.710
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:08.580
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:10.610
Every day it sparkles

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:14.310
Dokidoki Precure

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:21.190
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:26.850
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:32.500
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:37.950
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:43.640
If your friends are in trouble

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:52.520
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:54.190
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:56.590
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:59.430
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:02.240
What's more than just cute

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:06.100
is our promise between girls

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:12.140
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:18.050
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:29.990
A Gorgeous Transformation!

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:29.990
A Gorgeous Transformation!

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:35.960
Alice, you've been sighing a lot lately.

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:40.510
Perhaps you should take a respite, Madam.

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:42.240
Thank you, Sebastian.

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:48.150
Through Cure Ace's guidance,

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:53.110
Mana and Makoto have reached new heights and strengthened their powers.

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:57.320
I must better myself as those two have.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.560
Madam, you spare no effort in your pursuits.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:02.590
Yet it is still not enough.

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:04.560
I must try harder...

