00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:11.470
If you'd please.

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:25.430
Your fists are clouded! {Like "your mind is clouded," but with fists. Also, his "Dare" lines aren't subbed. I don't know what it means.}

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:35.150
I could never protect the others if I gave in here!

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:37.790
One more round!

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.260
Madam...

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:47.960
It seems the time has come to use this...

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:51.590
Created using the most cutting edge technology,

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:55.280
this artificial Commune was modeled after the genuine article!

00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:59.120
Now is the time for me to serve Madam.

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:02.240
Precure Love Link! {Literally Batman.}

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:25.100
If it is for Madam's sake, then I, Sebastian,

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:27.170
will stoop to any evil I must!

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:29.500
Now, begin the trial run!

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:32.690
Its speed is excellent!

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:34.410
Everything feels perfect!

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:37.110
This will certainly let me be of use to Madam!

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:41.480
Precure Sebastian Attack!

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:52.340
The princess ain't here.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:55.190
Say that once you've put some effort into looking.

00:05:55.190 --> 00:05:57.200
Oh, like you're one to talk?

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:59.530
And what's with the hat? Should I be callin' you Madam?

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:02.470
Sunburns are bad for my skin!

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:04.210
Oh, right!

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.230
I'll go relax in some negative ions! {Apparently some kind of health treatment.}

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:08.680
Hey, you ain't got time for a spa day!

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:14.630
Clear one's mind, and become refreshed.

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:19.030
Come here, my ions!

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:25.340
My, look at the time!

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:26.130
I must hurry!

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:34.800
Oh, where'd it go?

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:43.360
I swear on my title of head butler of the Yotsuba family that I shall support Madam!

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:49.860
What?!

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:55.650
Oh no, I need my sunscreen!

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:57.230
What's this?

00:06:57.550 --> 00:06:59.700
I feel like I've seen this before...

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:02.200
Precure Love Link!

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:05.110
Precure Love Link?

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:20.220
Huh?!

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:21.900
What <i>is</i> this?

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:23.980
You do this!

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:26.060
Oh, I see...

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:27.130
Wait.

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:29.650
Its manner of usage matters not.

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:35.190
What <i>does</i> matter is how the artificial Commune transformed into all of this.

00:07:35.190 --> 00:07:36.910
Artificial Commune?

00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:37.710
Ah!

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:43.140
There it is!

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:48.370
The artificial Commune is gone!

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:49.180
Gone!

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:51.320
Gone!

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:52.690
Sebastian?

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:54.070
Madam!

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.470
Is something the matter?

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:58.630
What's all this "artificial Commune" stuff about?

00:07:58.630 --> 00:08:00.390
Artificial Commune?

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:02.100
Oh, well...

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:03.920
Oh, incoming call!

00:08:04.970 --> 00:08:07.910
Alice, there's a Selfish going berserk in the Yotsuba Mall!

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:09.610
I'll be there immediately!

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:13.810
I must defend everyone this time!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.170
Um-yay! {Pig Latin because why not.}

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:20.760
Um-yay um-yay um-yay um-yay um-yay!

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:24.960
Eat yer fill!

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:27.160
Everyone, please escape!

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:33.260
Um-yay um-yay um-yay um-yay um-yay!

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:35.470
It's eating all the free samples!

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:40.230
If I fill up on free samples, I don't have to pay any money!

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:42.740
What a small-minded Selfish!

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:44.570
Don't call me small! {Imperfect translation here: Rikka uses an idiom to call the Selfish petty (lit. "small bowl") and the Selfish takes offense to the literal meaning of the idiom. This at least ties well into the rest of the conversation.}

00:08:46.890 --> 00:08:48.530
Your attacks sure are.

00:08:48.850 --> 00:08:50.880
You gonna take that, Selfish?

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.720
Time to get big!

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:53.650
Self!

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:55.150
They grow up so fast!

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:02.960
Who might you be?

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:08.070
I can't simply hide my identity after being asked, can I?

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:10.810
My name is... uh...

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:12.560
Brimming with love,

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:14.940
Cure Heart!

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:19.590
Yeah, just like that!

00:09:19.590 --> 00:09:21.740
Brimming with beauty,

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:22.370
Cu—

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:25.280
—tie Madam!

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:28.030
Tea Madam?

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:29.750
It's Cutie Madam!

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:31.690
So, you're married?

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:34.220
No, she's no Madam, she's just Mammo! {Rikka is a goddamn genius.}

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:38.120
Hey, did you eat something you found on the ground?

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:43.980
<i>What a turn of events!</i>

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:47.000
<i>She undoubtedly transformed using the artificial Commune!</i>

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:50.530
<i>To think it would fall into the hands of the enemy...</i>

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:06.480
So, what?

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:10.480
There's so much wrong here, I don't know where to begin.

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:11.960
What are you up to?

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:14.430
<i>This is a grave matter!</i>

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:16.970
<i>I could get used to this.</i>

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:19.750
<i>Nobody can take their eyes off of my new look!</i>

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:25.710
Shaddup!

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:27.780
You almost messed up my hair!

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:29.010
Have some table scraps!

00:10:29.010 --> 00:10:30.840
Seeeeelf!

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:32.180
Girls, let's go!

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:41.280
Precure Lovely Force Arrow

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:58.560
Love love loooooove!

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:07.210
Enjoy your just desserts! {I know it's supposed to be "deserts," but puns.}

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:10.150
Hey!

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:11.820
Whose side are you on?

00:11:12.550 --> 00:11:13.860
Curious...

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:15.040
What was that?

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:17.640
Did Mammo have a change of heart?

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:22.300
<i>I must recover the artificial Commune at all costs!</i>

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.570
Look at this article.

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:33.860
"The Black Beauty, Cutie Madam, Appears!!" {TS without ""}

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:37.340
It seems she's been appearing here and there to help people.

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:40.450
Oopsie!

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:43.370
Hey, look up there!

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:44.720
Oh no!

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:46.590
S-Someone help me!

00:11:47.030 --> 00:11:48.120
Not yet.

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:50.390
I need a full audience.

00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:56.760
A male construction worker is in a dire situation!

00:11:58.560 --> 00:11:59.900
Here's my chance!

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:04.400
The hero saves the day again!

00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:08.290
My name is Cutie Madam!

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:10.740
I'm a strong, beautiful lady! {who don't need no man}

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:14.130
I'm open for autographs!

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:18.400
What's Mammo after?

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:20.870
It's hard to think she's had a change of heart...

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:26.090
But she's saving people, so something in her had to change, right?

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:28.610
Her look sure changed, though.

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:31.270
I think she's gotten cuter!

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:34.140
I hear she's even getting a lot of female fans!

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:36.070
I am <i>so</i> not into her.

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:43.880
Regardless, we need to investigate what her plans are and what power she used to transform.

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:46.460
We should split up and search for her.

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:47.160
Yeah.

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:51.210
Alice, is something wrong?

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:54.990
Oh no, nothing at all.

00:12:57.220 --> 00:13:00.200
Where? Where are you, Cutie Madam?

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:01.890
I mean, Mammo!

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:06.840
There?

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:09.520
Wow, it's Cutie Madam!

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:10.710
You're gorgeous!

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:12.390
Could you put that visit on the house?

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:13.960
Of course!

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:17.550
I've been looking for you.

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:19.840
Who... er, what are you?

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:23.550
You may call me the Steel Butler.

00:13:23.890 --> 00:13:25.520
The Steel what?

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:28.990
Enough! Return the artificial Commune at once!

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:33.460
Oh, so that was yours...

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:35.450
Now, return it!

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:37.170
And if I refuse?

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:39.160
I shall retrieve it by force.

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:40.630
Feel free to try!

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:42.400
My apologies in advance!

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:47.440
This is nothing!

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:52.520
I must not lose.

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:54.210
I must not be defeated!

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:00.940
Now, if you'll excuse me!

00:14:02.990 --> 00:14:04.460
Sebastian!

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:07.930
I'm deeply sorry, Madam.

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:12.220
I'm the one who should apologize.

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:20.480
You developed the artificial Commune out of your wholehearted desire to protect my powerless self.

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:22.610
I apologize for being an unfit master.

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:24.430
That's absurd!

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:28.700
Madam, you are the greatest master a servant could ask for!

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:36.180
Come to think of it, you always did protect me.

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:39.580
You'd break my fall when I tripped on a stone,

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:43.440
scare off the monsters in a haunted house when I got scared,

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:47.670
and make me laugh on lonely, sleepless nights.

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:54.110
It is now my turn to protect you.

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:04.250
