00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:04.250
H{*\frz364.091}e{*\frz363.182}r{*\frz362.273}o{*\frz361.364}g{*\frz360.455}e{*\frz359.545}r {*\frz357.727}S{*\frz356.818}h{*\frz355.909}ow

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.300
This is the end, Heroger!

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:04.250
Your grave shall be dug here!

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:07.460
I shall protect Earth's peace!

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:12.770
Out of the way!

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:17.040
You...

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:19.120
My name is Cutie Madam!

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:21.600
I'm a strong, beautiful lady! {who still don't need no man}

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:27.060
<i>Not bad.</i>

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:28.580
<i>I think I'll join in on the fun.</i>

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:32.000
Hey, you! Your grave shall be dug here!

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:32.610
Huh?

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:34.920
Farewell, Heroger!

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:41.450
I am justice!

00:15:41.450 --> 00:15:43.460
I am the strongest!

00:15:47.390 --> 00:15:48.600
Stop this foolishness!

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:51.400
You're only making the children cry!

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:54.290
I'm the hero today.

00:15:54.290 --> 00:15:56.640
And I won't have anyone upstage me!

00:15:56.880 --> 00:16:01.610
This power exists to make my wildest dreams come true!

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:05.980
Then I shall stoop to any evil I must to stop you!

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:09.420
For the children, and for the butler who loves me so!

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:12.220
Madam...

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:14.220
Sebastian, protect the children!

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:14.840
Right!

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:16.430
Now, we must escape!

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:24.630
Lance!

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:29.240
Precure Love Link!

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:31.070
L-O-V-E!

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:31.770
L-O-V-E!

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:32.520
L-O-V-E!

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:33.660
L-O-V-E!

00:16:59.980 --> 00:17:01.690
The warmth of the sun,

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.080
Cure Rosetta!

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:09.580
Prepare yourself, false hero, Cutie Madam!

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:12.480
You're the one who should watch out!

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:19.490
You're really into it today. {We sometimes forget that the karate master who only uses shields can actually fight. Hi, Heartcatch!}

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:30.930
Girls, let's go!

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:33.700
Charles!

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:37.570
Precure Love Link!

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:38.510
L-O-V-E!

00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:39.230
L-O-V-E!

00:17:39.230 --> 00:17:39.910
L-O-V-E!

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:41.000
L-O-V-E!

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:54.490
Brimming with love,

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:56.560
Cure Heart!

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:00.830
The light of wisdom,

00:18:01.670 --> 00:18:03.060
Cure Diamond!

00:18:04.840 --> 00:18:06.260
The blade of courage,

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:08.400
Cure Sword!

00:18:15.140 --> 00:18:18.400
Precure Sparkle Sword!

00:18:23.140 --> 00:18:25.330
Return the artificial Commune!

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:27.410
That's mine now.

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.290
I already wrote my name on it.

00:18:29.590 --> 00:18:32.400
Then I shall retrieve it by force!

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:38.210
For Sebastian, who has protected me all this time!

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:44.340
You've discovered your love, Cure Rosetta.

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:45.590
Cure Ace...

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:48.940
You protect, and are protected.

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.480
The Precure's Five Vows!

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:52.350
First!

00:18:52.350 --> 00:18:54.610
To love is to defend one another!

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:58.420
Protect each other at all times to protect your love!

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:00.390
Right!

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:04.030
Now Ai, let's go!

00:19:06.150 --> 00:19:08.960
Precure Dress Up!

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:11.730
Kyupirappa!

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:58.910
Love's trump card,

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:00.440
Cure Ace!

00:20:02.850 --> 00:20:05.490
Beauty is the mark of the righteous!

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:08.280
With a single wink,

00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:11.260
I shall pierce your heart!

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:28.880
Beautify!

00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:31.350
Love Kiss Rouge!

00:20:40.490 --> 00:20:42.050
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:43.620
Ace Shot!

00:20:43.620 --> 00:20:44.890
Bang!

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:53.430
How'd you do that?

00:20:53.430 --> 00:20:55.540
Now, Cure Rosetta!

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:58.410
I won't lose to you!

00:20:59.350 --> 00:21:02.410
Precure Rosetta Reflection!

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:16.110
She reflected it!

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:17.190
Amazing!

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:18.490
She powered up!

00:21:22.350 --> 00:21:24.340
What was that for?!

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:26.620
I liked that alter ego!

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:30.660
Well done, Cure Rosetta.

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:34.670
You're a warm, yet strong girl.

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:36.640
Cure Ace...

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:42.680
I'm sorry, Sebastian.

00:21:43.140 --> 00:21:45.440
I broke the artificial Commune...

00:21:45.440 --> 00:21:46.650
Think nothing of it.

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:50.620
You needed no such thing.

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:55.670
The tea you make truly is the best.

00:21:55.670 --> 00:21:58.330
I hope you can make it for a long time to come.

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:01.500
As do I.

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:04.960
{ED}

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:09.110
What do I want in life?

00:22:09.110 --> 00:22:10.580
Didn't you want to be a doctor?

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:14.310
Yeah, but I don't know if that's really <i>my</i> dream anymore...

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.320
Uncertainty of the heart leads to weakness!

00:22:17.320 --> 00:22:20.250
This is an excellent chance to sort out your feelings!

00:22:20.250 --> 00:22:22.790
And when you're troubled, you go to the beach!

00:22:22.790 --> 00:22:24.560
Who knows where this could lead us?

00:22:24.560 --> 00:22:26.560
Let's hope it's nowhere weird...

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:28.660
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:31.600
How Do You Really Feel?

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:31.600
How Do You Really Feel?

00:22:31.960 --> 00:22:34.070
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
